# Responsive UI

- **Mobile first**: base styles for phones; enhance with `sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`.
- Breakpoints to verify: ~390 (phone), ~768 (tablet), ≥1024 (desktop).
- No horizontal scroll on common viewports.
- Sticky headers/footers: use `scroll-mt-*` for in-page anchors.
- Touch-friendly controls; avoid hover-only critical actions.
- Images/media: responsive sizing; prefer Next.js `Image` when real assets land.
- Prefer CSS/Tailwind layout over JS measurement.
- Safe areas: respect `env(safe-area-inset-*)` for fixed bottom UI.
- Cards/sections: stack on mobile; multi-column from `md`/`lg` up.
